            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Sorry, this feels a bit too much for 'mini.bracketed'. This type of navigation traditionally done with `]<C-q>` and `[<C-q>` and this is what Neovim has by default. However, it is not something that I'd want to support in 'mini.bracketed'.",
