        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Sorry to bother, I just think :cnf is more useful than :cn for dealing with compilers output and makes no difference for grep output. And `]<Ctrl-q>` is very awkward to type. I map `]q` to `:cnf` myself, but I like the wrap of mini/bracketed.    ",
